me  video that the lvmpd gave to the  family's council  the video was originally obtained by the  lvnpd and is one piece of evidence that  is being evaluated  in the ongoing investigation and the  police department went on to add  asking people if they have any video of  what happened here again on june 1st of  last year  just as a black lives matter protest  crowd was disbursing  to share it with them reporting from  downtown hector mejia  8 news now
 

